{
    "$about": "Procedural ice surface. Every key here is a shader uniform (surfaceSize is also the mesh scale) except qualityMode, cracksEnabled, bubblesEnabled, frostEnabled and frostBlur, which compile blocks of the shader in or out and cost one program build each time they change. Defaults are the Clear Frozen Lake preset in ENHANCED mode: the scene under the ice is read from the shared framebuffer grab and displaced, so whatever is swimming down there bends. Switch qualityMode to performance for the mobile path — alpha-blended transparency, no grab, no sample. Tune in the lab, then paste the exported JSON back over this file.",
